  "title": "Pen hatching driven by lighting",
  "purpose": "Pen-and-ink shading from scene lights: brighter areas stay paper, darker areas get one, two, three and four layers of hatching lines at different angles, aligned to the surface UVs so the strokes stick to the object.",
