    "inputs": [
      "A mesh with reasonably even UVs; keep the environment ambient light low so shadows stay dark."
    ],
    "outputs": "Paper-white shapes shaded with layers of crossing ink lines that thicken toward the shadow side."
  },
  "limits": "Lines follow UVs, so seams and stretched UVs show in the strokes. Each light adds its own hatching. Ambient light is added unhatched. Lines alias into moire when UV density is far higher than screen pixels.",
